[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765867095","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104833#issuecomment-2765867095","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104833","id":2765867095,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k28hX","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T10:53:32Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T10:53:32Z","body":"Sounds related to:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104337","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765867095/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788239822","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104833#issuecomment-2788239822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104833","id":2788239822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mMSnO","user":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T04:21:03Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T04:21:03Z","body":"Here's what I've gathered from looking into this:\n\n## Cause\n\nIt looks like this is due to #98131—\n\nPrior to that PR, streams were faded in and out when they started or stopped playing on a bus.\n\nThe change from the PR made streams no longer fade in so that transients at the start of a stream would not be damped.\n\nHowever, streams still kept the fade-out behavior.\n\nSo, when switching buses, the new stream starts immediately, but the old stream continues to play through its fade-out, meaning that **both streams** play for that ~10ms duration.\n\nThe resulting mix therefore jumps to 2x the current sample value before fading down to the correct 1x value, causing a click.\n\n## Potential solutions\n\nSimply commenting out [audio_server.cpp:505](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4248411baf7a81b49e827f3f17d9dcc4b53b6c6a/servers/audio_server.cpp#L505) disables the fade-out and thus prevents the issue.\n\nHowever, this naive approach allows clicks to occur if a stream is stopped while at a non-zero frame, meaning users would have to manually manage fades if they wish to stop streams partway through.\n\nThus, a more detailed design is likely necessary to provide sensible behavior for these simple use-cases.\n\nOne solution that comes to mind would be to expose the fade duration as a parameter, allowing cases such as `set_bus` to switch streams immediately, while still providing useful default behavior for simple usages such as `play`/`pause`/`stop`.\n\nI may try to put together a PR, though I would be eager to hear others' thoughts on this idea or alternatives.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788239822/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788719004","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104833#issuecomment-2788719004","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104833","id":2788719004,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mOHmc","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T08:07:07Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T08:07:07Z","body":"CC @adamscott @KeyboardDanni ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788719004/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2801226779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104833#issuecomment-2801226779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104833","id":2801226779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m91Qb","user":{"login":"MJacred","id":6639237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzkyMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6639237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred","html_url":"https://github.com/MJacred","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T10:17:08Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T10:17:08Z","body":"Related to / possible duplicate of: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/77669\n\nSee also